    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS INTERNSHIP(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是提供學生進入相關產業實習的機會，目的在加強理論與實務的結合，並強化學生的專業技能，藉此提升未來的競爭能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The course is designed to provide students with an internship opportunity to work in an enterprise. This internship program integrates accounting theory and accounting practice and, moreover, strengthens students’ professional skills and competitiveness.",
